; Windows exports for every plug-in in this project.
;
; VDJ_API is __stdcall on Windows, so on x86 an extern "C" export is decorated
; as _DllGetClassObject@12 and VirtualDJ's GetProcAddress("DllGetClassObject")
; misses it. Naming it here re-exports it undecorated. On x64 and ARM64 there
; is no decoration in the first place and this file changes nothing, which is
; why it is applied unconditionally.
EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject
